-- title:
--   Parity representative refinement and cyclic specialization
-- statement:
--   This bundle relates the orbit families generated by parity representatives to the legacy square-representative families. For typed square entries on a product of cyclic groups, it defines cyclic parity representatives using the positive observed square support, its multiplicity function and the product half solver.
--
--   The accompanying coverage and orbit-family identities allow parity generation to replace legacy generation while preserving all torsion orbits of compatible triples.
